{
  "about": "Everything Accel (the voice assistant) can do. Each action has an id (the app's frontend/src/accel/intent-ids.json must list the same ids), a description the AI reads, the details it may need (slots), and example sentences in English, Filipino and Taglish. More examples = better understanding: add freely, then restart the AI service and the vector index rebuilds by itself.",
